  m_Text: 'This scene demonstrates the streaming of deferred prefabs.

    The idea
    behind this is to cut down load time by avoiding the deserialization of all prefabs
    in the scene at once.

    Inspect the Player''s component ''Defered Prefab Radius
    Streamer''


    How to use this scene:

    1. Clcik on the Instantiate Button

    2.
    Save the game via Save Slot Manager (Tools/Crystal Save/Runtime Debug/Save Slot
    Manager Window)

    3. Load the game

    4. Move the player'
